<title>SWITZERLAND: Forbo sees better 1997 results.</title>
<headline>Forbo sees better 1997 results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fobro Holding AG said it expected better full year results as compared to 1996.</p>
<p>It said the essentially short-term nature of its business made a prediction for the next six months speculative.</p>
<p>&quot;It is, however, reasonable to anticipate that newly found positive trends will persist and thus a year-end result better than 1996 may be expected. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7304</p>
</text>
